  "title50px": "Create your own food court with ease",
  "subtitle-hover-block-html": "\n            <p>Manage your food court efficiently with a single point of contact. </p>\n            <p>Innovorder is the only French service provider able to deploy 100% of the solutions required to manage your food court: order taking, collection, preparation, delivery and management.</p>\n          ",
  "title50px-2": "Take advantage of the best of foodtech",
  "subtitle-hover-block-html-2": "\n            <p>Ask for the most advanced digital solutions to manage your food court: table orders, smartphone orders, multi-corners, multi-baskets, real-time monitoring and alerts of order preparation between corners, consolidated reports for the operator and dealers, etc.</p>\n          ",
  "expertise-img-alt-2": "",
  "expertise-img-src-2": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59ac741a01d5_food%20court%2022.avif",
