  "title50px-3": "Push back the field of possibilities",
  "subtitle-hover-block-html-3": "\n            <p>Benefit from the advice of our fast food experts to co-create innovative order paths, optimize your space and pilot the launch of your corners, no matter how complex your project is.</p>\n          ",
